Caddy attribution

Caddy v2.11.2 is downloaded separately from its official release:
https://github.com/caddyserver/caddy/releases/tag/v2.11.2
The upstream LICENSE is included as LICENSE.caddy. The upstream tag has no
root NOTICE file. This attribution is supplied by the kit, not by upstream.

Caddy and its dependencies may have additional license and notice requirements.
Those dependencies must be reviewed before distribution.
